      "role": "user",
      "content": "i used to believe everything happened for a reason. like there was some kind of plan or a light at the end. but lately it just feels like... nothing. like i'm just staring into this massive, freezing dark and there's nobody there. it’s terrifying. i feel so empty and honestly, i don't see the point in any of it anymore.",
